{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxkKDjMP3iqgoGcJuZG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with **Harel, the \"מניות\" track, kupa number 8522.** I'm fairly sure, not totally.\n\nWhat decided it: Harel is a name I know, and it's the first company on the list. Its row says the fee is \"0.55% מהחיסכון\" and \"0% מההפקדות\", which is about as low as anything I saw. It also shows \"24.04%\" for 3 years, the biggest number in that first block. So it's cheap, it's a big name and it went up the most. The 30,000 goes in there, plus a few hundred a month. First step is to look up Harel's kupat gemel lehashkaa and open that track.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** Big heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". The \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" button was already selected, so I knew I was in the right place. Under \"במה הכסף מושקע\" there were too many buttons. I left it on \"הכול\".\n- **Screen 2:** The Harel block. I only read the track names and the big green numbers. Saw \"S&P 500 עוקב מדד\", the thing my friends talk about, at 13.7%. Then \"מניות\" at 24.04% for the same fee, so מניות looked better.\n- **Screens 3 to 5:** Scrolled fast. Mor had higher fees, 0.67% to 0.73%, and a lot of rows just said \"פחות מ־3 שנים\". Analyst had \"גמיש\" with 26.39%. That's even higher, but I've never heard of Analyst, so I didn't trust it. Meitav was starting when I stopped. I quit after screen 5 of 15 because it was just more of the same.\n\n**What I skipped:** The small line under the heading with the dates and \"123 מקור\". The \"?\" icons. The \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\" column with the circles. The fund numbers. The \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" link.\n\n**Words I didn't get:**\n- \"מט\"ח\", with numbers like 99% or 25%\n- \"מההפקדות\" next to 0%\n- \"לפני דמי ניהול\"\n- \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\"\n- Why \"הלכה\" is a track\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- There are 143 tracks and many of them look the same. I almost closed the page.\n- Many rows say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a number.\n- One Harel row shows \"עוד לא דווח\" with an orange warning mark.\n- In Meitav, מניות says \"101%\". I didn't get how it can be over 100.\n- I'm not sure whether 24.04% is for each year or the total over 3 years."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3774,"cache_read_input_tokens":9899,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3774},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3acd643-20fb-449a-9a0d-c11e62d8b5eb","uuid":"50670f5d-da02-4c5f-8915-e94a5eabb875","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:07:14.708Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxkJvczSpyvXvLj71Ld"}
